ons.":"音量、靜音、圖形品質、語言、減少動態效果、高對比和文字大小皆位於 StarHermit 選項中。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Change keys and buttons":"變更按鍵與按鈕","Arrow keys move between cells, {mark} marks ({call} marks a focused cell, otherwise calls), {claim} claim, {undo} undo in Practice, {hint} hint, {pause} pause, {camera} reset camera, {back} back.":"方向鍵在格子間移動，{mark} 標記（{call} 標記聚焦的格子，否則為呼叫），{claim} 宣告，{undo} 練習中悔棋，{hint} 提示，{pause} 暫停，{camera} 重置鏡頭，{back} 返回。","{n} of {max} seats taken — empty seats play as lanterns.":"{n} 或 {max} 座位已被佔用 — 空位就像燈籠一樣。","Start round":"開始回合","Waiting for the host to start the round…":"等待主持人開始回合…","Playing as {name}":"以 {name} 身分遊玩"}
